  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "31bc8493-c16f-4b60-969b-894008f11f9b",
    "name": "Polymarket APIs (CLOB and Gamma) CLOB Market Data CLOB Trade API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Polymarket exposes several HTTP APIs documented at\nhttps://docs.polymarket.com/:\n\n  * CLOB API (`https://clob.polymarket.com`) for order book,\n    trading, and pricing operations.\n  * Gamma API (`https://gamma-api.polymarket.com`) for read-only\n    market, event, and metadata access.\n\nThis specification captures a representative subset of endpoints\nfrom both surfaces. CLOB trading endpoints require the\nPOLY_API_KEY / POLY_ADDRESS / POLY_SIGNATURE / POLY_PASSPHRASE /\nPOLY_TIMESTAMP header set; Gamma endpoints are fully public.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Polymarket Documentation",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
